./docs/deployment-modes.md:246:The local Node executable uses stdio by default. Opt into local HTTP mode with the `--transport http --host <host> --port <port>` flags [[44]](https://github.com/chrisdoc/hevy-mcp/blob/47eac6bd864bbfc1d66bbd48881df895e1a4214e/README.md#L505-L506). This mode is distinct from the stateless Cloudflare Worker: the Node server owns stateful client sessions and shares an in-memory cache across concurrent sessions within the same running process [[45]](https://github.com/chrisdoc/hevy-mcp/blob/47eac6bd864bbfc1d66bbd48881df895e1a4214e/README.md#L521-L523).
